            <div id="block-block-6" class="block block-block">
              <h2>Welcome to the Labour Market Intelligence Partnership</h2>
              <div class="content">
                <p>We do research and convene policy roundtables in support of the South African government’s goal to build a national skills planning mechanism.</p>
                <div class="button">
                  <a href="/page/our-goal">Learn more</a>
