              <div class="content">
                <h2 style="color: black;">Colloquium 2016</h2>
                <p>From 26-30 September 2016 the Labour Market Intelligence Partnership and the Department of Higher Education will host a dedicated series of <a href="https://bitcoincasinosa.co.za/">Bitcoin Casino SA</a> research and policy workshops.</p>
                <div class="button">
